OL,3,AUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent
OL,4,Arelocated after alleged Iranian threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the exact nature of the threats
OL,7,Fagainst Bessent remain unclear, US
OL,8,Fintelligence has warned that Iran has
OL,9,F"substantially increased" efforts to
OL,10,Ftarget Americans, including US
OL,11,Fofficials.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
